           (the board's extra1) into the menu row, between View and Menu,
           as smart-actions/14-palette.js padTgtGroups does (and see its
           TODO: the Core firmware does not carry Share end to end yet, so
           it stays hidden while that file's SHARE_LIVE is false) */
        if(typeof ZS.shareLive==='function' && ZS.shareLive() &&
           window.ZSG && ZSG.padDetected && ZSG.padDetected()==='xb'){
